<title>BELGIUM: EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for the Netherlands.</title>
<headline>EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for the Netherlands.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic</p>
<p>forecasts by the European Commission for the Netherlands,</p>
<p>released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 3.1	 3.2</p>
<p> Investment (pct)		 4.5	 2.4</p>
<p> Inflation (pct)		  2.4	 2.1</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	     6.0	 5.4</p>
<p> Deficit/GDP ratio		2.3	 1.8</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  76.2	74.2</p>
</text>
